  unitName: Wild Bandit Zaza
  unitId: 30063
  unitNumber: 314
  description: A bandit from the forested mountain bordering the ruined Vriksha Duchy.
    After his subordinates were killed by the gods, it is said he was drained of
    emotion and sought revenge against the gods, relentlessly chopping away at them
    with his axe. He was feared by not only the gods but humans as well, and his
    unwavering anger led him to be known as the "Wild Bandit." However, he continued
    slashing ahead with his axe, unaware of the title bestowed upon him.
  summonDesc: Are you god or ally?<br>If you're going after them<br>then my axe may
    be of use!
  fusionDesc: Give me more power!<br>At this rate, I won't be able<br>to hold back
    my rage!
  evoDesc: Did you feel my rage?<br>I continue swinging my axe<br>so they can rest
    at ease.
  element: 3
  rarity: 3
